{"quote_id": "2020-03-19-060198", "split": "watch", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-19-060198"], "speaker": "Scott Morrison", "quotation": "That work will be done by states and territories, as it is a state and territory matter, and that work will be led by Western Australia, together with New South Wales, working with all the other states and territories, to bring back some model that can be applied in hardship cases.", "n_domains": 11, "as_of": "2020-03-20T02:38:45", "query_url": "http://cairnspost.com.au/business/coronavirus-in-australia-renters-experiencing-hardship-will-be-protected-by-a-relief-model/news-story/a17fbedfea1b591fb48cecdc293cb43a", "verbatim": "Scott Morrison said: \"That work will be done by states and territories, as it is a state and territory matter, and that work will be led by Western Australia, together with New South Wales, working with all the other states and territories, to bring back some model that can be applied in hardship cases.\"", "paraphrase": "Scott Morrison said the work would be carried out by the states and territories, since the matter falls under their responsibility, and would be headed up by Western Australia and New South Wales, working alongside all other jurisdictions to restore a model that could be used in hardship cases.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-19T13:00:00", "domain": "coffscoastadvocate.com.au", "url": "https://www.coffscoastadvocate.com.au/news/relief-for-renters-impacted-by-virus/3977195/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-19T13:00:00", "domain": "coffscoastadvocate.com.au", "url": "https://www.coffscoastadvocate.com.au/news/relief-for-renters-impacted-by-virus/3977195/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-24-004399", "split": "watch", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-24-004399"], "speaker": "Peggy Flanagan", "quotation": "And she said, `Yes, absolutely. I want to make sure there's some good that comes out of this for people, that's what he would want.' And so that is why I shared the (Instagram) post, that is why I'm talking to you about it, that it's important people take this seriously.", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-03-25T00:34:00", "query_url": "https://www.duluthnewstribune.com/lifestyle/health/5014600-Minnesotas-Lt.-Gov.-Peggy-Flanagan-on-losing-brother-to-COVID-19-\u2018We-just-ran-out-of-time\u2019", "verbatim": "Peggy Flanagan said: \"And she said, `Yes, absolutely. I want to make sure there's some good that comes out of this for people, that's what he would want.' And so that is why I shared the (Instagram) post, that is why I'm talking to you about it, that it's important people take this seriously.\"", "paraphrase": "Peggy Flanagan said she agreed without hesitation that some benefit should come from the tragedy for others, believing that was what the deceased would have wanted, and explained that she had shared the Instagram post and was speaking to reporters because she felt it was crucial that the public treat the matter seriously.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-24T18:18:05", "domain": "thedickinsonpress.com", "url": "https://www.thedickinsonpress.com/lifestyle/health/5014600-Minnesotas-Lt.-Gov.-Peggy-Flanagan-on-losing-brother-to-COVID-19-\u2018We-just-ran-out-of-time\u2019", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-24T18:18:05", "domain": "thedickinsonpress.com", "url": "https://www.thedickinsonpress.com/lifestyle/health/5014600-Minnesotas-Lt.-Gov.-Peggy-Flanagan-on-losing-brother-to-COVID-19-\u2018We-just-ran-out-of-time\u2019"}}
