{"quote_id": "2020-01-22-004026", "split": "watch", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-22-004026", "2020-01-23-095980", "2020-01-23-070632"], "speaker": "Matt Hancock", "quotation": "All the fatalities have so far been contained to mainland China; however, this is a rapidly developing situation and the number of deaths and the number of cases is likely to be higher than those that have been confirmed so far and I expect them to rise further,", "n_domains": 8, "as_of": "2020-01-23T12:24:50", "query_url": "https://www.belfasttelegraph.co.uk/news/uk/nhs-ready-to-respond-to-coronavirus-if-outbreak-spreads-to-uk-health-secretary-38888699.html", "verbatim": "Matt Hancock said: \"All the fatalities have so far been contained to mainland China; however, this is a rapidly developing situation and the number of deaths and the number of cases is likely to be higher than those that have been confirmed so far and I expect them to rise further,\"", "paraphrase": "Matt Hancock said that all deaths so far had been limited to mainland China, but warned that the situation was evolving quickly and that the true numbers of fatalities and infections were likely to exceed the confirmed figures, and he expected both to climb further.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-22T17:31:50", "domain": "newsletter.co.uk", "url": "https://www.newsletter.co.uk/health/could-the-deadly-coronavirus-spread-to-northern-ireland-and-how-worried-should-we-be-1-9210969", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-22T17:31:50", "domain": "newsletter.co.uk", "url": "https://www.newsletter.co.uk/health/could-the-deadly-coronavirus-spread-to-northern-ireland-and-how-worried-should-we-be-1-9210969"}}
